<lead>Two quick checks on chapter one.</lead>
<quiz id="c1" question="Is ℤ/6 a field?" correct="B" hint="Look for a zero divisor.">
<option feedback="2 · 3 = 0 in ℤ/6, so 2 has no inverse.">yes</option>
<option feedback="Right: 2 · 3 = 0, so it has zero divisors.">no</option>
</quiz>
<quiz id="c2" question="Which are subspaces of ℝ²? (pick all)" type="multi" correct="A,C">
